651
00:44:32,041 --> 00:44:33,208
Ayah tahu kenapa?

652
00:44:33,291 --> 00:44:36,208
Dia belum sadar
Ayah akan pergi lagi sebentar lagi

653
00:44:36,291 --> 00:44:38,291
